**Others**The Role



AVP/VP, Bond Trader, Fixed Income Department


Key Accountabilities


* Responsible for the market\\-making in secondary bond market and cash bond quotations, providing market liquidity for customers;
* Provide foreign exchange and interest rate products quotations and trading services for clients;
* Communicate with the sales team on market conditions, cooperate with sales team to actively expand business;
* Actively participate in market trading activities to make profit: prepare reports on trading activities and market performance on regular basis;
* Manage the risks of the trading book, ensuring trading process complies with internal policies, trading limits, legal and compliance requirements;
* Such other duties as shall from time to time be directed by your superiors.


Skills \\& Experience


* Degree Holder or above in finance or related business discipline;
* 5\\+ years of fixed income trading experienced;
* Familiar with financial market products and understand the compliance requirements of regulatory authority;
* Hold or eligible to apply RA1 and RA4 licenses from the SFC;
* Strong organizational and communication skills, with good analytical capability;
* Strong analytical and computer skills with demonstrated proficiency in Microsoft Office;
* Good spoken and written Chinese and English, including Mandarin;
* Candidates with over 2 years of full time working experience in Hong Kong or overseas is considered as an advantage.


